      "utf8": "hold on a second let\nme get some headphones"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 535560,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We need real speakers or something."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 550240,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What do you hear Abe?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 551500,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hold on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 556780,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I hear shave and a haircut two bits"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 561040,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "here, listen this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 562180,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All right. \n-here, I'll hold it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 564900,
    "dDurationMs": 740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thank you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 572040,
    "dDurationMs": 640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 574140,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and... pitch shift"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 577320,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[recovered sound of Shave and a haircut, two bits]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 586420,
    "dDurationMs": 6440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "yep there you go,\nvisual microphone. [laughter]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 592860,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this was a basic proof"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 594750,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of concept but Abe showed that with more\npowerful equipment he could recover"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 598900,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "human speech from outside soundproof\nglass."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 615280,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Have you ever considered that your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 616940,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "computer is a physical system that gives\noff vibrations each key on the keyboard"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 621209,
    "dDurationMs": 4891,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "produces a unique sound due to its\nunique location. In fact, research has"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 626100,
    "dDurationMs": 5460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "shown that audio recordings of typing\nreveal 96% of keystrokes accurately."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 631560,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now this portion of the video was sponsored\nby LastPass, an app that stores all your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 635250,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "usernames and passwords so you never\nhave to type them in. And this prevents"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 638670,
    "dDurationMs": 3779,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "people from stealing your passwords by\nsay recording audio of your keystrokes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 642449,
    "dDurationMs": 2051,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or just looking over your shoulder."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 644500,
    "dDurationMs": 1910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What's even better is the convenience of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 646410,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "never having to fill in usernames and\npasswords or getting locked out again"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 650040,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With LastPass you don't have to write\nremember or reset passwords."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 654200,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You get unlimited password storage and free\ncross-device sync."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 657940,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you open an app"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 658740,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or site on your computer or on an iOS or\nAndroid device LastPass fills in your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 662970,
    "dDurationMs": 4619,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "username and password this saves you\nvaluable brain space so put your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 667589,
    "dDurationMs": 2091,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "passwords on autopilot with LastPass."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 669680,
    "dDurationMs": 1930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now\nsomething I particularly like is if you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 671610,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "upgrade to LastPass premium you get\nadvanced multi-factor authentication and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 675000,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it works like magic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 676480,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So click the link\nbelow to find out more about LastPass"
    } ]
